stream
ID,Source,Date,Feedback Text
F001,Email,2024-03-01,The onboarding process was smooth and the team was very helpful. Loved the welcome kit!
F002,Survey,2024-03-02,Delivery took 3 weeks instead of the promised 5 days. Very disappointed.
F003,Survey,2024-03-03,Product quality is excellent but the packaging was damaged when it arrived.
F004,Support,2024-03-04,I have been waiting 2 weeks for a refund. Nobody is responding to my emails.
F005,Email,2024-03-05,Great experience overall. The mobile app is intuitive and easy to navigate.
F006,Survey,2024-03-06,Prices are competitive but I wish there were more payment options available.
F007,Support,2024-03-07,The product stopped working after 10 days. Replacement process is complicated.
F008,Email,2024-03-08,Customer service representative was rude and unhelpful when I called.
F009,Survey,2024-03-09,Fast shipping and the product is exactly as described. Will definitely reorder.
F010,Support,2024-03-10,Cannot log into my account. Reset password link does not work. Urgent please.
F011,Email,2024-03-11,The new product update is amazing. Performance has improved significantly.
F012,Survey,2024-03-12,Instructions manual is confusing. Took 2 hours to set up a simple device.
F013,Support,2024-03-13,Website keeps crashing on mobile. I cannot complete my purchase.
F014,Email,2024-03-14,Best customer support I have ever experienced. Issue resolved in 10 minutes!
F015,Survey,2024-03-15,Good product but overpriced compared to competitors offering similar features.

endstream
endobj
